message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "HydroElasticFEM.jl"
abstract: >-
  A Julia package for finite element (FE) simulation of hydro-elastic
  wave-structure interaction problems. It couples potential flow fluid
  models with structural models (membranes, Euler-Bernoulli beams,
  resonators) using the Gridap.jl FE framework.
